sequenceDiagram

    actor SuperAdmin
    participant Client as MAUI / Web Client
    participant API as Reconciliation API
    participant Service as Reconciliation Service
    participant Expense as Expense Service
    participant Advance as Advance Service
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant Audit as Audit Service

    SuperAdmin->>Client: Open advance reconciliation
    Client->>API: GET /advances/{id}/reconciliation

    API->>Advance: Get advance and funds issued
    Advance->>DB: Query advance
    DB-->>Advance: Advance data

    API->>Expense: Get approved expenses
    Expense->>DB: Query approved expenses
    DB-->>Expense: Expense data

    API->>Service: Calculate financial position

    Service->>Service: Evaluate funds issued
    Service->>Service: Evaluate approved expenses
    Service->>Service: Evaluate additional funds
    Service->>Service: Evaluate returns/reimbursements

    Service-->>API: Reconciliation result
    API-->>Client: Display reconciliation

    SuperAdmin->>Client: Confirm reconciliation
    Client->>API: POST /reconciliations/{id}/close

    API->>Service: Finalize reconciliation
    Service->>DB: Save reconciliation
    Service->>Audit: Record immutable closure event

    Service-->>API: Reconciliation closed
    API-->>Client: Closed / read-only